# A CI checkout holds only the files git tracks, so this list holds only what git does not track: the
# image a machine builds is then the file set CI builds, and no folder the build reads is left out.
# Docker and podman both read this file.
# The image names its commit with QUE_COMMIT instead, and ships no history.
.git

# The installs and the build's output: the image makes its own, and a checkout on a machine can hold
# ones built elsewhere.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Settings and secrets of a machine's own checkout. An image never holds a secret.
.env
.env*.local
